{
  "abstract": "From a study of 1226 neutral strange particles produced in pp interactions at 69 GeV/ c in the MIRABELLE hydrogen bubble chamber, we obtain the inclusive cross sections for K S 0 , \u039b / \u03a3 0 , \u039b / \u03a3 0 equal to 3.43 \u00b1 0.23, 3.44 \u00b1 0.2 and 0.16 \u00b1 0.03 mb, respectively. The inclusive distributions are compared with corresponding data at other energies.",
